@startuml
 title GPS technical flow
participant "Rastreador GPS" as Device
participant "gps-backend TCP :8842" as GPS
actor "web/mobile" as Client

Device -> GPS: Trama binaria (login / heartbeat / location)
GPS -> GPS: Decodifica and saves in memoria
GPS --> Device: ACK with CRC-16
Client -> GPS: GET /API/gps/devices/{imei}/location
GPS --> Client: last position known
@enduml

